Model Understanding Enrichment From Developer Interaction

During validation, a series of technical questions were submitted to the model vendor (TradingHub) to strengthen model understanding. Their responses clarified the mathematical construction of MRI, Narrative/Counter-Narrative, and the materiality scoring framework. Key points include:

MRI maps market-risk exposure into USD space to offset Narrative values.

Variance aggregation across risk dimensions justifies the squared terms in Sensitivity × σ × √t.

Sensitivities drive both expected profit (Narrative) and principal risk (Counter-Narrative).

The exponential decay functional form moderates Narrative inflation under high-risk conditions.

Market-impact memory logic explains cost calculations used for Narrative and Counter-Narrative.

These insights were incorporated into the validation assessment and helped confirm conceptual soundness, parameter interpretation, and appropriate alignment to surveillance objectives.
